The misleading result is because the system only has 14 users and 74 texts
to translate. I'm sure when Wikipedia, Myspace, del.icio.us, digg and Flick=
r
got started there was a day when they were that size. All of them needed a
lot of users and thousands of tiny contributions before they became
effective powerhouses. By harnessing the wisdom of crowds, jboselkei could
end up being one of the best things to happen to Lojban ever.

